From: Kris Chaplin <kris.chaplin@amd.com>
Date: Mon, 19 Jan 2026 11:36:12 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Add Xilinx dummy src kconfig

Signed-off-by: Kris Chaplin <kris.chaplin@amd.com>
---
 drivers/media/platform/xilinx/Kconfig | 6 ++++++
 1 file changed, 6 insertions(+)

diff --git a/drivers/media/platform/xilinx/Kconfig b/drivers/media/platform/xilinx/Kconfig
index 660a41d53304..8a50edafb1eb 100644
--- a/drivers/media/platform/xilinx/Kconfig
+++ b/drivers/media/platform/xilinx/Kconfig
@@ -197,3 +197,9 @@ config VIDEO_XILINX_AXI4S_SUBSETCONV
 	  mapped in this driver.
 	  To compile this driver as a module, choose M here.
 	  If unsure, choose N
+
+config VIDEO_XILINX_DUMMY_SRC
+       tristate "Xilinx Dummy Source"
+       depends on VIDEO_DEV && MEDIA_SUPPORT
+       help
+         Enable the Xilinx dummy source driver.
